{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0JvbGx5d29vZC8yMDAxLS0yMDEwL1ByYW4lMjBKYWF5ZSUyMFBhciUyMFNoYWFuJTIwTmElMjBKYWF5ZSUyMCUyODIwMDMlMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Pran Jaaye Par Shaan Na Jaaye","description":"Aman Joshi (Aman Verma) is on a research assignment. His subject is the chawl dwellers in Bombay City. He rents a small tenement there and talks to the people living there. He soon gets involved in their lives, and even gets attracted to plain-looking Saundarya (Divya Mirza), who he transforms into a beauty, after a cosmetic makeover. Aman's kindness is mistaken for generosity by all the chawl dwellers, and they swarm him for his money, trying to get loans and gifts, to improve their lives. Then the lives of this small community are turned upside down, when the owner announces that he intends to tear the building down.\n\nReleased 1 May 2003 · India · Language: Hindi · 137 min\n\nOn your server — Audio: Hindi","releaseInfo":"2003","genres":["Drama","Bollywood"],"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/pubTYJUMggDa6ttltMow4yFWrU0.jpg","imdbRating":"7.0","imdb_id":"tt0330783","moviedb_id":138510,"tmdbId":138510,"runtime":"137 min","cast":["Raveena Tandon","Namrata Shirodkar","Rinke Khanna","Divya Dutta","Shweta Menon","Sushmita Sen","Vijay Raaz","Aman Verma"],"director":["Sanjay Jha"],"writer":["Mahesh Manjrekar","Sanjay Pawar"],"released":"2003-05-01T00:00:00.000Z","country":"India","language":"Hindi","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Sanjay Jha","character":"Director"},{"name":"Raveena Tandon","character":"Laxmi Rathod","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/4z0X9ZMgyNZRHfJG4G2Z10rhLpu.jpg"},{"name":"Namrata Shirodkar","character":"Mona","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/hQ0RYfjDiTkyTawyAQh7b1sHEmC.jpg"},{"name":"Rinke Khanna","character":"Suman","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ra9qS7YVKBUMBgVCLm0WMZSeCMO.jpg"},{"name":"Divya Dutta","character":"Dulari","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/yedHuFQSzH9tpVj2v5lnKPCO